<title>JAPAN: Toyota Tsusho - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyota Tsusho - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		782.77		vs	  745.15</p>
<p> Operating	    4.49		vs	    3.75</p>
<p> Current		4.54		vs	    3.78</p>
<p> Net		    2.18		vs	    1.99</p>
<p> EPS		    8.61 yen	  vs	    7.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    253 million	  vs	 253 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyota Tsusho Corp is a trading company.</p>
